# BEANSHEAL Platform — Project Overview

액상 건기식 OEM/ODM 통합 플랫폼 (Next.js 15 App Router).

## Product naming

| Name | Surface | Entry |
|------|---------|-------|
| **BEANSHEAL Platform** | Whole system | — |
| **BEANSHEAL Connect** | Customer site | `/` → `public/homepage.html` |
| **BEANSHEAL Workspace** | Internal ERP | `/login`, `/workspace`, `/orders`, … |

Constants: `src/lib/branding.ts`

## Layout split (`LayoutContent.tsx`)

- **Full-width** (no Sidebar): `/`, `/login`
- **Workspace shell** (Sidebar + `bg-slate-100`): all routes under `src/app/(workspace)/`

## Key integrations

- **Supabase**: auth, recipes, production orders, inventory, CMS data — client `@/lib/supabase`, actions in `src/app/actions/`
- **Notion**: production calendar sync — `notionActions.ts`
- **Ecount**: stock scraping/API — `ecount.ts`, `scripts/ecountBot.ts`
- **Brand assets**: wordmark `public/images/beansheal-logo.png`, favicon `public/favicon.ico`

## Do not break

- `/` must stay **BEANSHEAL Connect** (rewrite or iframe), not Workspace dashboard.
- Workspace dashboard lives at `/workspace`, not `/`.
- Logo link in Sidebar → `/workspace`.
